---
import SectionHead from './SectionHead.astro';
import UnitChart from './UnitChart.astro';
import { markerBg } from '../data/zero-drift';
---

<section aria-labelledby="when-head" class="container-page flex flex-col gap-12 pb-section">
  <SectionHead id="when-head" caption="When to bring us in" headingClass="max-w-[18ch]">
    If one of these sounds like your team, talk to us.
  </SectionHead>
  <div class="panel-wrap">
    <ul class="panel grid-4">
      <li class="when-cell">
        <span class="when-num"><i aria-hidden="true" class:list={['marker', markerBg.sage]}></i>01</span>
        <h3 class="m-0 text-h3-card">Your design file and your repo have drifted apart</h3>
        <p class="m-0 text-body-sm text-pretty text-ink-2">
          At Everbreed, 53 variables had drifted between Figma and code, and nobody could tell a rename
          from a delete.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-auto flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <UnitChart count={53} hot={53} columns={18} cell={8} label="53 cells, one per drifted variable" />
          <span class="caption-sm text-muted">53 drifted variables</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="when-cell">
        <span class="when-num"><i aria-hidden="true" class:list={['marker', markerBg.lavender]}></i>02</span>
        <h3 class="m-0 text-h3-card">The product was built for years without a designer</h3>
        <p class="m-0 text-body-sm text-pretty text-ink-2">
          At QBench, every screen was a developer’s best guess, and each new feature meant relearning
          decisions nobody wrote down.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="when-cell">
        <span class="when-num"><i aria-hidden="true" class:list={['marker', markerBg.peach]}></i>03</span>
        <h3 class="m-0 text-h3-card">The library looks healthy, but a machine can’t use it</h3>
        <p class="m-0 text-body-sm text-pretty text-ink-2">
          At Everbreed, all 302 variables had no scope and no code name. Fine for people, unreadable for a
          pipeline.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-auto flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <UnitChart
            count={302}
            columns={22}
            cell={6}
            label="302 cells, one per variable, none with a scope"
          />
          <span class="caption-sm text-muted">302 variables · 0 scoped</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="when-cell">
        <span class="when-num"><i aria-hidden="true" class:list={['marker', markerBg.butter]}></i>04</span>
        <h3 class="m-0 text-h3-card">Your team is handing design to AI agents</h3>
        <p class="m-0 text-body-sm text-pretty text-ink-2">
          A developer fills the gaps in a Figma file. An agent guesses, and every guess becomes a
          correction pass.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .when-cell {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    min-height: 360px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
  }
  .when-num {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
  }
  @container panel (max-width: 519.98px) {
    .when-cell {
      min-height: 0;
      padding: var(--spacing-cell);
    }
  }
</style>
